nee":{"login":"james-baker","id":89615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker","html_url":"https://github.com/james-baker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-baker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Intentional-Society/is-app/pulls/643","html_url":"https://github.com/Intentional-Society/is-app/pull/643","diff_url":"https://github.com/Intentional-Society/is-app/pull/643.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Intentional-Society/is-app/pull/643.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Summary: The Buttondown sync reconciles every profile's existing subscriber and gates only subscriber creation on a saved profile.\n\nWhy: The sync skipped every profile with a null `lastUpdatedProfile`, which froze the Buttondown tags of 21 CSV-imported members at their cutover state — one left Gumball Machine on 2026-09-08 and kept the tag.\n\nBehavior: Unsaved profiles with an existing subscriber (by stored id or by email) get managed tags and `metadata.name` reconciled like saved ones. Unsaved profiles with no subscriber are skipped, counted as `skippedUnsavedCreate` and logged as `skipped-unsaved-create`; the inline first-save hook still owns their creation. The next daily cron (08:00 UTC) will strip stale program tags from those members' subscribers.\n\nTest Plan:\n- ran `npm test` locally (after rebasing onto main: 741 functional, 37 e2e passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Intentional-Society/is-app/issues/643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Intentional-Society/is-app/issues/643/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/issues/124","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/issues/124/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/issues/124/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/issues/124/events","html_url":"https://github.com/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/pull/124","id":6018094017,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQDsIms8AAAABKf8V-g","number":124,"title":"Buscador: sugerencias con el catálogo, aviso mensual y enlaces de «Especiales» limpios","user":{"login":"willyaranda","id":679157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTE1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/679157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda","html_url":"https://github.com/willyaranda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willyaranda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/pulls/124","html_url":"https://github.com/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/pull/124","diff_url":"https://github.com/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/pull/124.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/pull/124.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- **Sugerencias con el catálogo:** al escribir en «¿Qué necesitas?» salen también los 415 trámites de la sede. El navegador los pide una vez, la primera vez que se usa la caja, a `/wp-json/aranda-de-duero/v1/tramites` (~19 KB comprimidos, caché de 1 h); no viajan con cada página. Van detrás de los servicios curados.\n- **Aviso mensual** (día 1) para refrescar `data/sede/tramites.json`; el aviso semestral vuelve a ser solo delegaciones y horario.\n- **Seguridad:** el enlace de cada «Especial» pasa por `esc_url_raw()`, así que un `javascript:` ya no llega al índice de sugerencias.\n\n**Verificado:** 216 tests, phpstan, phpcs, lint:php y ESLint.\n**No verificado:** el comportamiento en la web real (se comprueba tras subirlo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011LuXXJkXUY2dwuQAtdfCGT","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arandadeduero/wp-tema-arandadeduero/issues/124/reactions","tot